  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">African Climate Smart Agriculture Initiative with Global Research Alliance (GRA) (MPI)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Activity will enable&#xa0;countries in Southern and Eastern Africa&#xa0;to increase their engagement with the Global Research Alliance in order to develop and implement effective technologies/practices to mitigate global agricultural greenhouse gas emissions, and to build regional capability in agricultural emissions measurement.</narrative>
  </description>
